# D2 REPLICATION on the recipe: DIAG's 9B SWE-Gym overfit (8 rand48 tasks x 8 per step, LR 3e-5, overlong = 0) with merged
# serving, no MTP loss, CPU reserve, save every step. The original (MTP on, adapter serving) is configs/archive/swegym-9b/
# diag-overfit8-lr3e-5-olzero.env: +.23 +-.06 paired success by steps 20-26, 8/8 tasks up.
RUN_NAME=9b-swegym-overfit8-recipe-r1
LAYOUT_PRESET=9b-1n
DATASET=swegym-lite-v3
TASK_IDS_FILE=${HM_EXAMPLE_DIR}/configs/tasks/swegym-overfit8.txt
CAP=64k
NUM_ROLLOUT=40
